WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:07.262
The relationship tarot spread uses seven cards to look
at two people and the connection between them.

00:00:07.262 --> 00:00:10.743
It suits any kind of relationship, not
just romantic ones.

00:00:12.043 --> 00:00:13.217
The seven positions.

00:00:13.217 --> 00:00:19.206
You, the other person, the connection between you, what
brings you together, then what is challenging.

00:00:20.506 --> 00:00:21.220
The layout.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:25.568
Card 1 sits on the left and card 2 on the
right, facing each other.

00:00:25.568 --> 00:00:28.099
Card 3 goes in the centre between them.

00:00:29.499 --> 00:00:31.919
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:31.919 --> 00:00:36.825
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
